  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Set air fryer to 200°C. Roughly chop parsnip.\n• Peel and cut pumpkin into bite-sized chunks.\n• Slice capsicum into 2cm chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, toss the veggies with a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• Add to the air fryer basket and cook for 10 minutes. Shake the basket, then cook until tender, a further 5-10 minutes.\n• TIP: No air fryer? Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Place parsnip, pumpkin and capsicum on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b5150875049c063d84d4/step-243d3200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Rinse red lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b5150875049c063d84d4/step-6955f210.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook half the garlic until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Transfer to a small bowl.\n• Add Greek-style yoghurt (see ingredients) and mix to combine. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b5150875049c063d84d4/step-dd473c20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return saucepan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook tomato, stirring, until starting to soften, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add ginger paste, mild curry paste and remaining garlic. Cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b5150875049c063d84d4/step-5ace4830.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in coconut milk, stock concentrate, red lentils, the water and brown sugar. Bring to the boil, then reduce heat to medium.\n• Cover with a lid and cook, stirring occasionally, until lentils are softened, 20-22 minutes.\n• Stir in roasted veggies and baby spinach leaves, until wilted and combined. Season to taste.\n• TIP: Add a splash of water to loosen the curry, if needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b5150875049c063d84d4/step-2a6b6d40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide veggie-loaded lentil curry between bowls.\n• Top with garlic yoghurt.\n• Sprinkle over flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b5150875049c063d84d4/step-33a77350.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
